,"\n","User query:\n","\n","> \"Find affordable laptops under $800.\"\n","\n","You need both semantic search and structured filtering.\n","\n","### Metadata filtering\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":62,"id":"43f24574","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.120325Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.11996Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.437627Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.436972Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.341803,"end_time":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.439681+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.097878+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[],"source":["results = collection.query(\n","    query_texts=[\"Affordable laptop for programming\"],\n","    n_results=5,\n","    where={\n","        \"$and\": [\n","            {\"category\": \"laptop\"},\n","            {\"price\": {\"$lt\": 800}},\n","            {\"available\": True}\n","        ]\n","    }\n",")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"eb5fa801","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.020791,"end_time":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.481409+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.460618+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["\n","This example shows a combination of conditions.\n","\n","The result is restricted to records that match the metadata conditions, then ranked by semantic similarity.\n","\n","Chroma supports metadata filtering through `where` and document-content filtering through `where_document`.&#x20;\n","\n","**Common metadata operators**\n","\n","| Operator | Meaning                        |\n","| -------- | ------------------------------ |\n","| `$eq`    | Equals                         |\n","| `$ne`    | Not equal                      |\n","| `$gt`    | Greater than                   |\n","| `$gte`   | Greater than or equal          |\n","| `$lt`    | Less than                      |\n","| `$lte`   | Less than or equal             |\n","| `$in`    | Value is in a list             |\n","| `$nin`   | Value is not in a list         |\n","| `$and`   | All conditions must match      |\n","| `$or`    | At least one condition matches |\n","\n","For example:\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":63,"id":"da6b1ce9","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.524901Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.524531Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.837909Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.83701Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.33726,"end_time":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.840013+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.502753+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[],"source":["results = collection.query(\n","    query_texts=[\"AI engineering courses\"],\n","    n_results=10,\n","    where={\n","        \"$and\": [\n","            {\"category\": {\"$eq\": \"education\"}},\n","            {\"year\": {\"$gte\": 2024}}\n","        ]\n","    }\n",")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"971f1bb6","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.027085,"end_time":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.889976+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.862891+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["### Document filtering\n","\n","Suppose you want documents containing the word \"Python\".\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":64,"id":"c6c52028","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.945704Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.945163Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.950442Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.949777Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.032644,"end_time":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.952175+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.919531+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[],"source":["results = collection.get(\n","    where_document={\n","        \"$contains\": \"Python\"\n","    }\n",")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"4e081c97","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.019858,"end_time":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.99258+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-13T06:32:37.972722+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["This is different from semantic search. Semantic search retrieves by meaning. Document filtering searches for content matching a condition.\n","\n","### Weaviate vs ChromaDB\n","\n","| Feature | Weaviate | ChromaDB |\n","|---|---|---|\n","| Semantic Search | `query.near_text()` | `collection.query()` |\n","| BM25 Search | `query.bm25()` | `collection.search()` with sparse ranking |\n","| Hybrid Search | `query.hybrid()` | `collection.search()` with dense + sparse ranking |\n","| Filtering | `filters` | `where` |\n","| Reranking | Additional reranker integration | Additional reranker integration |\n","\n","# FAISS\n","\n","FAISS (Facebook AI Similarity Search) is an open-source library developed by Meta AI for efficient similarity search and clustering of dense vectors. It helps you find the most similar vectors from a large collection of vectors.\n","\n","FAISS is particularly useful in:\n","\n","- Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)\n","- Semantic search\n","- Recommendation systems\n","- Image similarity search\n","- Document retrieval\n","- AI chatbots\n","- Face and object embedding search\n","- Nearest Neighbor search\n","\n","Official GitHub repository: [FAISS GitHub Repository](https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss)\n","\n","## Importance\n","\n","Imagine you are building a RAG chatbot that answers questions from 1 million PDF documents. Your system has converted all documents into embeddings.\n","\n","For example:\n","\n","| Document | Embedding          |\n","| -------- | ------------------ |\n","| Doc 1    | [0.12, 0.45, 0.78] |\n","| Doc 2    | [0.91, 0.21, 0.32] |\n","| Doc 3    | [0.14, 0.43, 0.81] |\n","| Doc 4    | [0.77, 0.11, 0.55] |\n","| ...      | ...                |\n","| Doc 1M   | [0.23, 0.67, 0.12] |\n","\n","A user asks:\n","\n","> What is machine learning?\n","\n","You convert this question into a query embedding. Now, you need to find the documents whose embeddings are most similar to the query embedding.\n","\n","Without an efficient index, you might compare the query against every single document embedding. This is called brute-force search.\n","\n","FAISS provides optimized techniques to perform this search efficiently.\n","\n","![FASIS Core Concept](faiss_core_concept.png)\n","\n","FAISS is primarily a vector search library, not a complete managed vector database.\n","\n","For example, FAISS does not automatically:\n","\n","- Generate embeddings\n","- Store your original text documents\n","- Provide a full database API\n","- Manage distributed clusters\n","- Handle complex metadata filters by itself\n","- Generate answers with an LLM\n","\n","You can build these capabilities around FAISS.\n","\n","![RAG Complete Pipeline](rag_complete_pipeline.png)\n","\n","## FAISS Index Types\n","\n","The index is the core component of FAISS.\n","\n","An index determines:\n","\n","- How vectors are stored\n","- How vectors are searched\n","- How much memory is required\n","- Whether search is exact or approximate\n","- How fast retrieval is performed\n","\n","FAISS contains many indexes. The main ones you should understand are:\n","\n","### Exact Search: `IndexFlatL2`\n","\n","`IndexFlatL2` is the simplest FAISS index. It performs brute-force search by comparing the query vector with every vector in the dataset.\n","\n","**How it works**\n","\n","Suppose the index contains 1 million vectors.\n","\n","When a query arrives:\n","\n","1. Compute the L2 distance between the query and vector 1.\n","2. Compute the distance to vector 2.\n","3. Continue through all 1 million vectors.\n","4. Rank the distances.\n","5. Return the top-k nearest vectors.\n","\n","Complexity, roughly:\n","\n","$$O(Nd)$$\n","\n","Where:\n","\n","- $N$ = number of stored vectors\n","- $d$ = embedding dimension"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":65,"id":"d2f41d52","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-13T